Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 21:52:52 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Show every page in the website header

Desktop lists Updates, Location data, Changelog, About and Report an
update beside the four tabs, with no More menu. Tablets keep Updates and
About inline and put the rest under More. Phones add More as a fifth tab
in the bottom bar.

